    {
      "id": "investigating-the-murder",
      "title": "Investigating the murder",
      "anchor": "Investigating_the_murder",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Part 1"
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "investigating-the-murder:1oh6y5",
          "html": "<b>(1/8)</b> Go to the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Kitchen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Kitchen</a> and investigate the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Nut_roast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">nut roast</a> located on a table in the southeast corner of the room.",
          "text": "(1/8) Go to the Kitchen and investigate the nut roast located on a table in the southeast corner of the room.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "investigating-the-murder:1g1suvp",
          "html": "<b>(2/8)</b> At the north-west part of the Fort, by the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Gates_(Fort_Forinthry)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">northern gates</a>, investigate the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Strange_satchel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">strange satchel</a> beside the rock (southeast of the guards).",
          "text": "(2/8) At the north-west part of the Fort, by the northern gates, investigate the strange satchel beside the rock (southeast of the guards).",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "~",
                  "text": "[Any option]"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "investigating-the-murder:1lfp6vo",
          "html": "<b>(3/8)</b> Talk to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Simon_(Murder_on_the_Border)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Simon</a> outside of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Town_Hall_(Fort_Forinthry)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Town Hall</a> and <i>Link</i> &quot;How to Poison Dummies for Dummies&quot;.",
          "text": "(3/8) Talk to Simon outside of the Town Hall and Link \"How to Poison Dummies for Dummies\".",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "2",
                  "text": "Link a clue to Simon."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "investigating-the-murder:2dnlaw",
          "html": "<b>(4/8)</b> Investigate the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Half-buried_box\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">half-buried box</a> in the northeastern corner of the fort.",
